<h3>7-Segment Decoder (<code>seg7</code>)</h3>
<p>Input <code>x[3:0]</code> (hexadecimal 0..F), output <code>seg = {a,b,c,d,e,f,g}</code> active high. Examples: <code>0 → 1111110</code>, <code>1 → 0110000</code>, <code>2 → 1101101</code>,
<code>3 → 1111001</code>, <code>4 → 0110011</code>, <code>5 → 1011011</code>, <code>6 → 1011111</code>, <code>7 → 1110000</code>, <code>8 → 1111111</code>, <code>9 → 1111011</code>,
<code>A → 1110111</code>, <code>b → 0011111</code>, <code>C → 1001110</code>, <code>d → 0111101</code>, <code>E → 1001111</code>, <code>F → 1000111</code>.</p>
