<p><em>Duration: 3 h · Files: <code>src/heartbeat.v</code>, <code>src/chenillard.v</code> (to complete); <code>src/top_f0.v</code> supplied</em></p>
<h3>Objectives</h3>
<p>Go through the <strong>whole tool chain</strong> (simulation → synthesis → place-and-route → bitstream → board) on a simple project;
understand pin constraints; discover that an FPGA has <strong>no reset</strong>; read a resource report.</p>
<h3>1. Check the Installation and the Board</h3>
<pre><code class="language-bash">iverilog -V | head -1 ; yosys -V ; nextpnr-ice40 --version ; icepack 2&gt;&amp;1 | head -1
lsusb | grep -i 0403        # the iCEBreaker board shows up as an FTDI chip
</code></pre>
