grep -n &quot;Critical path report&quot; -A 24 F4_timing_pll_dsp/build_src/pnr.log | head -40
</code></pre>
<p>Note the Fmax and describe the critical path (source, number of LUTs crossed, routing delay or logic delay?).</p>
