(<code>cp F4_timing_pll_dsp/exemples/mac16_lut_pipeline.v F4_timing_pll_dsp/src/mac16.v</code>), run the flow again. Note the new Fmax.
Is the goal reached? Where is the critical path now?</p>
<h3>4. Part 3 — The DSP Block</h3>
<p>Edit <code>lab.cfg</code>: replace <code>SYNTH_FLAGS=""</code> by <code>SYNTH_FLAGS="-dsp"</code> (Yosys option that allows multiplications to be mapped
onto the <code>SB_MAC16</code> hardware block). Then take the naive version again, then a version written for the DSP block: registers on the
inputs (<code>a_r</code>, <code>b_r</code>), register on the product, accumulation separate. Check in the report the line <code>ICESTORM_DSP: 1/ 8</code>.</p>
