<h3>Spécification de l'ALU (<code>alu8</code>)</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;"><code>op</code></th>
<th>Opération</th>
<th><code>y</code></th>
<th><code>carry</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">000</td>
<td>ADD</td>
<td><code>a + b</code> (8 bits bas)</td>
<td>retenue sortante (bit 8)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">001</td>
<td>SUB</td>
<td><code>a − b</code></td>
<td>1 si <code>a &lt; b</code> (emprunt)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">010</td>
<td>AND</td>
<td><code>a &amp; b</code></td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">011</td>
<td>OR</td>
<td><code>a \| b</code></td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">100</td>
<td>XOR</td>
<td><code>a ^ b</code></td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">101</td>
<td>SLL</td>
<td><code>a &lt;&lt; b[2:0]</code></td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">110</td>
<td>SRL</td>
<td><code>a &gt;&gt; b[2:0]</code></td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">111</td>
<td>SLTU</td>
<td><code>1</code> si <code>a &lt; b</code> (non signé), sinon <code>0</code></td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><code>zero = 1</code> quand <code>y == 0</code>.</p>
<h3>Décodeur 7 segments (<code>seg7</code>)</h3>
<p>Entrée <code>x[3:0]</code> (hexadécimal 0..F), sortie <code>seg = {a,b,c,d,e,f,g}</code> actif à 1. Exemples : <code>0 → 1111110</code>, <code>1 → 0110000</code>, <code>2 → 1101101</code>,
<code>3 → 1111001</code>, <code>4 → 0110011</code>, <code>5 → 1011011</code>, <code>6 → 1011111</code>, <code>7 → 1110000</code>, <code>8 → 1111111</code>, <code>9 → 1111011</code>,
<code>A → 1110111</code>, <code>b → 0011111</code>, <code>C → 1001110</code>, <code>d → 0111101</code>, <code>E → 1001111</code>, <code>F → 1000111</code>.</p>
